        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="43" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Diagram synced with code 09/28/25&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Alice: Seller&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Bob: Buyer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;P&#39; = MuSig2 aggregate of the key shares P&lt;sub&gt;a&lt;/sub&gt; and P&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; (p_tik), Q&#39; = aggregate of Q&lt;sub&gt;a&lt;/sub&gt; and Q&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; (q_tik)&lt;br&gt;an output with key spend P&#39; or Q&#39; is locked by that key, tweaked with its script spend 0 (if any)&lt;br&gt;U and V are script keys from the wallets of Alice and Bob&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;change outputs, funding from multiple inputs and trade fee outputs are not shown&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="560" x="10" y="-100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="44" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="Redirect Tx&lt;br&gt;Bob / Alice" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="260" x="1380" y="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="45" parent="44" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Outputs 0 ... n-1:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; key spend outputs to the n burning men." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="260" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="62" parent="44" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Output n:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; anchor output 330 sats.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;key spend:&lt;/b&gt; Pubkey of Bob / Alice" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="260" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="60" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1&gt;Transactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 230, 204);&quot;&gt;Funding transaction. Keys / Signature for spending come from the wallet crate. The signatures for all other transaction are made by the protocol crate, except for the CustomPayoutTx.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(213, 232, 212);&quot;&gt;Only the DepositTx is broadcasted at the time of creation, the transactions right of it will have the problem that the necessary fee rate is not known for the time they are broadcasted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(225, 213, 231);&quot;&gt;These transaction are presigned with MuSig2. They are created and signed when the trade starts (before the DepositTx is signed and broadcast). They need to be signed at the time when both traders are online.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(176, 227, 230);&quot;&gt;CustomPayoutTx and PenaltyTx are transaction signed on demand. The CustomPayoutTx is created when the traders agree on a payout, both wallets sign it with the script keys U and V. The PenaltyTx is signed by one trader alone, after the key exchange.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="560" x="30" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="64" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;" value="PenaltyTx&lt;br&gt;Bob / Alice" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="260" x="1380" y="-170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="65" parent="64" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="prepared by the protocol together with the presigned transactions, but signed only when needed, by Bob / Alice alone with the private key p&#39; / q&#39;. It disincentivises the use of the WarningTx, when Bob / Alice has the key already." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="260" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="66" parent="64" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Output 0:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; escrow - mining fee&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;key spend:&lt;/b&gt; Pubkey of Bob / Alice (same address as in the ClaimTx Bob / Alice)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" y="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
