        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="87" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1&gt;Relative lock times&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;nSequence of the inputs, see NetworkParams in transaction.rs:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;warning lock time (WarningTx): 1440 blocks (10 days), regtest 5 blocks&lt;br&gt;claim lock time (ClaimTx): 720 blocks (5 days), regtest 5 blocks&lt;br&gt;RedirectTx, SwapTx, PenaltyTx and CustomPayoutTx: none&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Mining fees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;fee rate x fixed weight of the signed transaction: WarningTx 846 wu, SwapTx / ClaimTx / PenaltyTx 444 wu, CustomPayoutTx 1182 wu. The RedirectTx pays what the receivers and the anchor leave over.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="540" x="640" y="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
